---
// Server-side Logic: 이력서 페이지 전용 독립 렌더링
---

<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Datasheet | CV</title>
    <style>
        /* [1. Datasheet Reset & Typography] */
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;700&display=swap');

        body, html {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #FFFFFF; /* 차가운 순백색 */
            color: #111111; /* 극단적인 대비를 위한 순흑색 */
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* [2. Layout Grid] */
        .datasheet-container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 4rem 2rem;
        }

        /* [3. Header Section] */
        .header {
            border-bottom: 3px solid #111;
            padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-end;
        }

        .title-block h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin: 0;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .title-block p {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0;
            color: #555;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .nav-back {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            color: #111;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border: 1px solid #111;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .nav-back:hover {
            background-color: #111;
            color: #FFF;
        }

        /* [4. Specification Tables] */
        .spec-section {
            margin-bottom: 4rem;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #CCC;
            padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .spec-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 3fr;
            gap: 1rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #EEE;
            padding-bottom: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .spec-key {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #555;
        }

        .spec-value {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        /* [5. Project Blocks] */
        .project-block {
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }

        .project-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: baseline;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .project-name {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .project-tech {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            background: #F4F4F4;
            padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .project-desc {
            color: #444;
            margin-top: 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="datasheet-container">
        <header class="header">
            <div class="title-block">
                <h1>Seol-11</h1>
                <p>Digital System Architect / FPGA Engineer</p>
            </div>
            <a href="/" class="nav-back">&lt; Return to Root</a>
        </header>

        <section class="spec-section">
            <h2 class="section-title">1.0 Technical Specifications</h2>
            
            <div class="spec-grid">
                <div class="spec-key">Hardware Description</div>
                <div class="spec-value">SystemVerilog, Verilog HDL</div>
            </div>
            <div class="spec-grid">
                <div class="spec-key">Software & DSP</div>
                <div class="spec-value">C/C++, JUCE Framework, Python</div>
            </div>
            <div class="spec-grid">
                <div class="spec-key">EDA Tools & Target</div>
                <div class="spec-value">Xilinx Vivado, ModelSim / Zynq-7000 SoC</div>
            </div>
            <div class="spec-grid">
                <div class="spec-key">Core Architectures</div>
                <div class="spec-value">AMBA AXI4-Lite, RISC-V ISA, UART 16550</div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="spec-section">
            <h2 class="section-title">2.0 Core Intellectual Property (Projects)</h2>
            
            <div class="project-block">
                <div class="project-header">
                    <h3 class="project-name">AXI4-Lite to UART 16550 Bridge IP</h3>
                    <span class="project-tech">SystemVerilog / Vivado</span>
                </div>
                <p class="project-desc">
                    Zynq SoC 환경에서 ARM 코어와 연동 가능한 고성능 UART 모듈 설계. 비동기 FIFO를 적용하여 Clock Domain Crossing(CDC) 문제를 해결하고, AXI 버스 프로토콜의 Deadlock 방지 구조를 FSM으로 완벽 구현함.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="project-block">
                <div class="project-header">
                    <h3 class="project-name">Real-time Audio DSP Filter (VST)</h3>
                    <span class="project-tech">C++ / JUCE</span>
                </div>
                <p class="project-desc">
                    디지털 신호 처리(DSP) 이론을 적용한 실시간 IIR/FIR 로우패스 필터 구현. 오디오 버퍼 레이턴시를 최소화하기 위한 메모리 최적화 및 C++ 객체 지향 아키텍처 적용.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
